 "text": "-->\nDixon Elevator - About Us\n-->\nAbout Us\nToggle Navigation\nABOUT US\nAbout Dixon Elevator\nHours\nOur Team\nDirectors\nLocations\nHARVEST POLICY\nCASH BIDS\nCash Bids Grid\nUSDA Cash Bids\nMARKET DATA\nMarket Overview\nFutures\nOptions\nCustom Charts\nSpread Charts\nMarket Heat Maps\nNEWS\nAg Newswire\nFinancial News\nInsideFutures\nUSDA News & Reports\nWEATHER\nLocal Weather\nWeather Center\nRadar Maps\nNOAA Weather\n-->\nAbout Dixon Elevator\nDixon Elevator has been locally owned since 1979. We are a full-service Grain Elevator offering Picked Up Grain Bids, Grain Storage, Grain Drying, and Marketing Options for your operation. We have locations in Dixon, Randolph, and Sholes, NE. We are a Channel Seeds dealer and offer Seed Treatment. We carry a full line of Kent, ADM, and Purina Feeds.\n-->\n© 2026 Barchart.com, Inc. All market data is hosted and powered by Barchart .\nInformation presented is provided 'as-is' and solely for informational purposes, not for trading purposes or advice, and is delayed. No representations are made by Barchart as to its informational accuracy or completeness.\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information\nExchange Delays\nBy using this site, you agree to the storage of cookies on your devices for enhanced navigation, site analysis, and Barchart's marketing. Data sharing with social media platforms might occur based on the privacy choices you make on those platforms. For specifics, see our our Privacy Policy .\nAccept",
